  "rationale": "No fleet facts yet, so I seed the front. The 50 MSPS throughput constraint forces 1 result/cycle, which only pipelined and pipelined_m provide (iterative/unrolled_k are cut anyway). I focus on W=14-18 and N=12-18 where the accuracy constraint (err <= 2^-12) is satisfiable with margin, and use round for best accuracy. I split budget 60/40 between the two families to map the area/Fmax trade-off: pipelined for the speed/area extreme and pipelined_m (m=2-4) for the intermediate power-optimal points, since the selection rule minimises power_index."
